OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum gains funding ahead of 30th
OL,4,Aanniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FA medical museum in Leeds has secured
OL,7,F#420,000 in funding ahead of its 30th
OL,8,Fanniversary next year.
OL,10,FThackray Museum of Medicine has been
OL,11,Fawarded the money from grant
OL,12,Forganisations led by the National
OL,13,FLottery Heritage Fund.
OL,15,FThe money will be spent on protecting
OL,16,Fthe Grade II listed building and a new
OL,17,Fexhibition, which is due to open in
OL,18,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
