OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum gains funding ahead of 30th
OL,4,Aanniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FEdward Appleyard, from the museum, said
OL,7,Fhe hoped the funding would enable them
OL,8,Fto have the "time and space to make
OL,9,FThackray even braver, more accessible
OL,10,Fand more sustainable for the future".
